  "body": "G.J. Gardner Homes Ready Living featuring a Custom design.\r\n\r\nNestled in the sought-after Anehana subdivision, this beautifully designed home combines comfort and style in a fantastic location.\r\n\r\nOffering three spacious bedrooms, a dedicated study, and two generous living areas, there’s plenty of room for both relaxation and entertaining. The chef-inspired kitchen with scullery flows seamlessly to the outdoors.\r\n\r\nA double garage and large laundry add everyday convenience, while stunning sea views complete the package.\r\n\r\nSecure your brand-new home in an exceptional location and enjoy all the benefits of modern living.\r\n\r\nPhone now to arrange a viewing.\r\n\r\nYour plan, our plans, or we can design from scratch. For more information visit our website http://www.gjgardner.co.nz\r\nMORE NEW ZEALANDERS TRUST G.J. GARDNER TO BUILD THEIR HOMES THAN ANY OTHER BUILDER.\r\n\r\nIf you’re thinking about building, make Home Prep the first step in your journey. It’s our essential step-by-step guide to the building process. Full of independent advice and handy information to help you have a great building experience. Get your free copy from gjgardner.co.nz today.\r\n\r\nCopyright G.J. Gardner Homes",
